& [Problem] is a false equivalence between test authorship and runtime execution commits

& [Decision] is two mandatory exact commit identities with distinct meanings
  + runtime checkpoint follows the implementation under test
  + corpus design checkpoint remains stable while exact corpus bytes are reused

& [Value] is honest regression continuity without corpus duplication or relabeling

& [Deferred] is independent authorship external benchmark registries and multi-runtime comparative reports
